<title>VENEZUELA: Interpetrol wins Uruguay gas oil tender - trade.</title>
<headline>Interpetrol wins Uruguay gas oil tender - trade.</headline>
<dateline>CARACAS 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Uruguay's state oil company ANCAP awarded a June gas oil purchase tender to Interpetrol and a fuel oil tender to YPF, a trader said on Monday.</p>
<p>The tender called for 45,000 cubic metres (283,500 barrels) of 0.8 percent sulphur, 45 cetane gas oil and 20,000 cubic metres (126,000 barrels) of one percent sulphur fuel oil for delivery on June 1-5.</p>
<p>((--Tom Ashby, Caracas newsroom, 582 505 2611))</p>
</text>
